1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,240
The draft in your stove has gotten worse. You're not imagining it.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:08,600
Soot in the pipe makes the stove draw worse. This chimney sweep kit has flexible rods.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:14,480
Screw together nine rods, three point six nine meters. They bend and don't get stuck.

4
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,240
Push in the brush. Pull through. Soot loosens.

5
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,440
Clean it yourself between the chimney sweep's visits.
